    "← → move one card, ↑ ↓ one row. ⇥ goes to its button and Close, ⏎ opens, ⌘⏎ opens in a new window, ⎋ closes.": {
      "comment": "All projects sheet: the filter field's tooltip listing the sheet's keys",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "← → move one card, ↑ ↓ one row. ⇥ goes to its button and Close, ⏎ opens, ⌘⏎ opens in a new window, ⎋ closes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "← → で 1 枚、↑ ↓ で 1 段移動します。⇥ でカードのボタンと「閉じる」に移り、⏎ で開き、⌘⏎ で新しいウインドウに開き、⎋ で閉じます。"
          }
        }
      }
