            "value": "その間に保存された内容は %@ に移動しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files can’t be swapped in one step where they are, so this isn’t available here.": {
      "comment": "Restore or discard: refused where files cannot be swapped in one step (FAT, exFAT, network, a nested volume)",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These files can’t be swapped in one step where they are, so this isn’t available here."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらのファイルはこの場所では一度に入れ替えられないため、この操作は使用できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It renames files to names this volume takes as the same, such as a case change: %@.": {
      "comment": "Restore: refused to rename files to names the volume takes as the same (a case change only); argument: the paths",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It renames files to names this volume takes as the same, such as a case change: %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このボリュームが同じ名前として扱う名前への変更（大文字と小文字だけの違いなど）があります：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git now converts these files on writing, so they wouldn’t get their bytes back: %@.": {
      "comment": "Undo of a discard: refused as Git converts the files on checkout; argument: the paths",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git now converts these files on writing, so they wouldn’t get their bytes back: %@."
