    "A trailing * matches the rest of a word. The last of these an agent runs in a turn shows with the turn. ✓ only means it exited with 0, not that the change is right. Remove every command to show no tests.": {
      "comment": "Project Settings footer under the test command list",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A trailing * matches the rest of a word. The last of these an agent runs in a turn shows with the turn. ✓ only means it exited with 0, not that the change is right. Remove every command to show no tests."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "末尾の * は単語の残りに一致します。エージェントがターン中に最後に実行したコマンドを、そのターンに表示します。✓ は終了コードが 0 だったことだけを表し、変更が正しいことは表しません。テストを表示しない場合は、すべてのコマンドを削除してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
