    "Click a shortcut to change it. Press ⎋ to cancel, or ⌫ to restore the default. To leave one unassigned, choose Unassign from its ⋯ menu. ⌘⏎ is kept for the main button under an agent’s pane, and ⌘1–9 and ⌃⌘1–9 for moving between tabs and worktrees.": {
      "comment": "Settings, Keyboard: footer under the shortcut list",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click a shortcut to change it. Press ⎋ to cancel, or ⌫ to restore the default. To leave one unassigned, choose Unassign from its ⋯ menu. ⌘⏎ is kept for the main button under an agent’s pane, and ⌘1–9 and ⌃⌘1–9 for moving between tabs and worktrees."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ショートカットをクリックすると、割り当てを変更できます。⎋ でキャンセル、⌫ でデフォルトに戻します。割り当てを解除するには、その行の ⋯ メニューで「割り当てを解除」を選択します。⌘⏎ はエージェントのペインの下にある主ボタンに、⌘1〜9 と ⌃⌘1〜9 はタブとワークツリーの移動に使うため、割り当てられません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active in every app, not only Limpid. Click to record a hotkey; press ⎋ to cancel or ⌫ to restore the default, which is no hotkey.": {
      "comment": "Settings, Quick Terminal: footer under the hotkey",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active in every app, not only Limpid. Click to record a hotkey; press ⎋ to cancel or ⌫ to restore the default, which is no hotkey."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limpid 以外のアプリの使用中にも有効です。クリックしてホットキーを記録し、⎋ でキャンセル、⌫ でデフォルト（ホットキーなし）に戻します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
