    "libghostty couldn’t allocate this pane. Choose Retry to try again.": {
      "comment": "Pane surface NULL recovery body",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "libghostty がこのペインを確保できませんでした。「再試行」をクリックしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only while the sidebar has focus. Elsewhere, the same keys move between panes.": {
      "comment": "Settings → Keyboard, hint of Move Project Up and Down: why they share keys",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
