    },
    "Shows the next item in this pane": {
      "comment": "Decision bar: tooltip of the count button",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このペインの次の項目を表示します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file can’t be reviewed as text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このファイルはテキストとしてレビューできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git couldn’t determine the comparison branch. Check the repository and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git が比較ブランチを特定できませんでした。リポジトリを確認して、もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git couldn’t load the changes. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git が変更を読み込めませんでした。もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git didn’t respond in time. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git が時間内に応答しませんでした。もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review comments couldn’t be saved. Keep Review open and try the change again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レビューコメントを保存できませんでした。レビューを閉じずに、もう一度操作してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save or cancel the comment before changing the review scope.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "範囲を変更する前に、コメントを保存するかキャンセルしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved review comments couldn’t be loaded or moved aside. This review starts empty, and changes to it aren’t saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みのレビューコメントを読み込めず、退避することもできませんでした。このレビューは空の状態から始まり、変更は保存されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved review comments couldn’t be loaded. This review starts empty.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みのレビューコメントを読み込めませんでした。このレビューは空の状態から始まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved review comments couldn’t be updated safely, so changes to this review aren’t saved and are lost when it closes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みのレビューコメントを安全に更新できなかったため、このレビューの変更は保存されず、閉じると失われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code this comment quotes appears more than once in this scope, so it can’t be placed.": {
      "comment": "Review: an earlier comment could not be moved, its quoted lines repeat",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このコメントが引用したコードはこの範囲に複数あるため、配置できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The comments weren’t inserted. They stay in this review.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コメントを挿入できませんでした。コメントはこのレビューに残っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The review instructions in Settings contain characters that can’t be sent to a terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定のレビュー指示に、ターミナルへ送信できない文字が含まれています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The snapshots of these turns are gone, so their record is incomplete and their changes can’t be shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらのターンのスナップショットが残っていないため、記録が不完全で、変更を表示できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This diff couldn’t be parsed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この差分を解析できませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review Scope": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レビューの範囲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn %lld of %@": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver, a turn's row on the worktree's timeline: the turn and its conversation; arguments: the turn's number, the conversation's name, as in Claude #4",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%2$@ のターン %1$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flat List": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一覧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder Tree": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フォルダ階層"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limpid couldn’t back up the saved file before updating it, because too many earlier backups are next to it. The file wasn’t changed.": {
      "comment": "Shown when a saved file could not be migrated because no free name was left for its backup copy.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以前のバックアップが多すぎるため、保存されたファイルを更新する前のバックアップを作成できませんでした。ファイルは変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limpid couldn’t back up the saved file before updating it. The file wasn’t changed.": {
      "comment": "Shown when the backup copy taken before migrating a saved file could not be written.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存されたファイルを更新する前に、バックアップを作成できませんでした。ファイルは変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limpid couldn’t update the saved file to this version. The file wasn’t changed.": {
      "comment": "Shown when a migration step for a saved file failed.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存されたファイルをこのバージョンの形式に更新できませんでした。ファイルは変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hotkey must include ⌃ or ⌘.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ホットキーには ⌃ または ⌘ を含める必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcut must include ⌃, ⌥, ⇧, or ⌘": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ショートカットには ⌃、⌥、⇧、⌘ のいずれかを含める必要があります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hotkey couldn’t be registered (error %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ホットキーを登録できませんでした（エラー %lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sidebar uses these keys while it has keyboard focus": {
      "comment": "Settings → Keyboard: Move Project Up or Down cannot take the sidebar's ⌥← ⌥→",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サイドバーにフォーカスがある間はサイドバーが使用するため、割り当てられません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show settings.json in Finder": {
      "comment": "Advanced pane button",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "settings.json を Finder で表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Ghostty config file in Finder": {
      "comment": "Settings, Integrations: VoiceOver name of Show in Finder for the Ghostty config",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ghostty の設定ファイルを Finder で表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Logs in Console": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コンソールでログを表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t Initialize libghostty": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "libghostty を初期化できませんでした"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quits and reopens Limpid.": {
      "comment": "Settings: tooltip of Relaunch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limpid を終了して、再度開きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the records of your agents’ turns are kept, and how many of the latest turns each conversation keeps. The days spare the unread turns of open conversations; the count applies to every turn. Making either smaller asks first when it would delete records, and deleted records can’t be recovered.": {
      "comment": "Settings, Advanced: footer of the turn history",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントのターンの記録を残す日数と、会話ごとに残す直近のターンの数です。日数は、開いている会話の未読のターンには適用されません。ターン数はすべてのターンに適用されます。どちらかを小さくして記録が削除されるときは、先に確認します。削除した記録は元に戻せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to %lld turn records will be deleted. This can’t be undone.": {
      "comment": "Settings, Advanced: the confirmation under a narrower turn history; the number of records it would delete",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Up to %lld turn record will be deleted. This can’t be undone."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Up to %lld turn records will be deleted. This can’t be undone."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最大 %lld 件のターンの記録が削除されます。元に戻すことはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restores every Limpid setting to its default. The app language and your settings.json on disk are both rewritten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limpid のすべての設定をデフォルトに戻します。表示言語とディスク上の settings.json も書き換えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an app that has a bundle identifier.": {
      "comment": "Advanced pane validation message for an app bundle without an identifier",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "バンドル識別子を持つアプリを選択してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected app can’t be used.": {
      "comment": "Advanced pane alert title for an invalid application selection",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択したアプリは使用できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the Ghostty config file again.": {
      "comment": "Settings, Integrations: tooltip of Reload",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ghostty の設定ファイルを再読み込みします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install and Relaunch": {
      "comment": "Update popover: primary install action",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "インストールして再起動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t launch git: %@. Check that git is installed.": {
      "comment": "Worktree-operation error — git binary failed to launch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "git を起動できませんでした：%@。git がインストールされているか確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hid worktree “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ワークツリー「%@」を非表示にしました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This worktree contains initialized submodules. To delete it anyway, choose Force Delete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このワークツリーには初期化済みのサブモジュールがあります。それでも削除する場合は「強制削除」を選択してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This worktree has uncommitted changes. To delete it anyway, choose Force Delete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このワークツリーには未コミットの変更があります。それでも削除する場合は「強制削除」を選択してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "git worktree add didn’t finish within %lld minutes, so Limpid stopped it and removed the partially created worktree. Check the repository’s hooks, such as post-checkout.": {
      "comment": "New session, the worktree stage: git worktree add ran past its deadline and was stopped, and what it had made was removed; the number is minutes",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "git worktree add が %lld 分以内に完了しなかったため、Limpid が停止し、作成途中のワークツリーを削除しました。post-checkout などのリポジトリのフックを確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "git worktree add didn’t finish within %lld minutes, so Limpid stopped it. The partially created worktree at %@ couldn’t be removed; remove it with git worktree remove --force. Check the repository’s hooks, such as post-checkout.": {
      "comment": "New session, the worktree stage: git worktree add ran past its deadline and was stopped, and the folder it left could not be removed; the number is minutes, then the folder",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "git worktree add が %lld 分以内に完了しなかったため、Limpid が停止しました。%@ の作成途中のワークツリーは削除できませんでした。git worktree remove --force で削除してください。post-checkout などのリポジトリのフックを確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder isn’t a Git repository, so changes can’t be tracked.": {
      "comment": "Changes panel: the worktree is not a Git repository",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このフォルダは Git リポジトリではないため、変更を追跡できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If anything fails, %@ is left unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: under the carry's checkbox; the argument is the shown worktree's branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失敗した場合、%@ は変更しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To move uncommitted changes, show a worktree of this project.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: under the carry's checkbox while the window shows another project's row, or none",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未コミットの変更を移動するには、このプロジェクトのワークツリーを表示してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t fetch from the remote, so the worktree starts from %@ as last fetched.": {
      "comment": "New worktree: the fetch failed and there is no local branch; the argument is the remote's branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リモートからフェッチできなかったため、前回フェッチした %@ から作成します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t fetch from the remote, so the worktree starts from the local %@.": {
      "comment": "New worktree: the fetch before it failed; the argument is the local branch it starts from",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リモートからフェッチできなかったため、ローカルの %@ から作成します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts from the latest %@ on the remote": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the line under the base with the fetch on; the argument is the remote's branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リモートの最新の %@ から作成します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files Git ignores, such as .env, copied from the project folder each time Limpid creates a worktree. One path or pattern per line.": {
      "comment": "Project settings sheet: footer of the files to copy into new worktrees",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ".env など Git が無視するファイルを、Limpid がワークツリーを作成するたびにプロジェクトのフォルダからコピーします。1 行に 1 つのパスまたはパターンを入力します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moved “%@” to Other Worktrees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」を「ほかのワークツリー」に移動しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next to the Project": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the folder menu's face for the folder beside the project's",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロジェクトと同じ階層"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next to the Project (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロジェクトと同じ階層（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has changes in a submodule or in a repository inside it, which Limpid can’t move. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the worktree to carry from changes a submodule; its branch, twice",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ has changes in a submodule or in a repository inside it, which Limpid can’t move. No worktree was created, and %2$@ is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ のサブモジュール、またはその中のリポジトリに変更があるため、変更を移動できません。ワークツリーは作成していません。%2$@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has unresolved conflicts. Resolve them first. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the worktree to carry from has unresolved conflicts; its branch, twice",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ has unresolved conflicts. Resolve them first. No worktree was created, and %2$@ is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ に未解決の競合があります。先に解決してください。ワークツリーは作成していません。%2$@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has files marked skip-worktree or assume-unchanged, or added with git add -N, which Limpid can’t move. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the worktree to carry from has state only its index holds; its branch, twice",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ has files marked skip-worktree or assume-unchanged, or added with git add -N, which Limpid can’t move. No worktree was created, and %2$@ is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ に skip-worktree または assume-unchanged が設定されたファイル、または git add -N で追加したファイルがあるため、変更を移動できません。ワークツリーは作成していません。%2$@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has no commits yet, so its changes can’t be moved. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the worktree to carry from has no commit; its branch, twice",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ has no commits yet, so its changes can’t be moved. No worktree was created, and %2$@ is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ にはまだコミットがないため、変更を移動できません。ワークツリーは作成していません。%2$@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is now a folder in %@ that holds files Git ignores, and moving the changes would remove them. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: a tracked file became a folder holding ignored files; the path, the source's branch, twice",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ is now a folder in %2$@ that holds files Git ignores, and moving the changes would remove them. No worktree was created, and %3$@ is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%2$@ では %1$@ がフォルダになっていて、中に Git が無視するファイルがあります。変更を移動するとそれらが削除されるため、ワークツリーは作成していません。%3$@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is in the middle of a merge, rebase, cherry-pick, or revert. Finish it first. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the worktree to carry from has an operation under way; its branch, twice",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ is in the middle of a merge, rebase, cherry-pick, or revert. Finish it first. No worktree was created, and %2$@ is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ でマージ、リベース、チェリーピック、またはリバートが進行中です。先に完了してください。ワークツリーは作成していません。%2$@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ uses a sparse checkout or a split index, which Limpid can’t move changes from. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the worktree to carry from is a sparse checkout or has a split index; its branch, twice",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ uses a sparse checkout or a split index, which Limpid can’t move changes from. No worktree was created, and %2$@ is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ はスパースチェックアウトまたは分割インデックスを使用しているため、変更を移動できません。ワークツリーは作成していません。%2$@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moving changes requires Git 2.40 or later. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: git merge-tree is too old for the carry; the argument is the source's branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更を移動するには Git 2.40 以降が必要です。ワークツリーは作成していません。%@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t read the changes in %@. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged. Details: %@": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: git failed reading the changes; the source’s branch, twice, then Git’s own words in English",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t read the changes in %1$@. No worktree was created, and %2$@ is unchanged. Details: %3$@"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ の変更を読み込めませんでした。ワークツリーは作成していません。%2$@ は変更していません。詳細：%3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The changes in %@ conflict with %@ in %@. No worktree was created, and %@ is unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the changes conflict with the start; the source, the start, the paths, the source again",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The changes in %1$@ conflict with %2$@ in %3$@. No worktree was created, and %4$@ is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ の変更は %3$@ で %2$@ と競合します。ワークツリーは作成していません。%4$@ は変更していません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move uncommitted changes": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the carry's checkbox while the window shows no worktree of this project",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未コミットの変更を移動する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move uncommitted changes from %@": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: move the shown worktree's uncommitted changes into the new one; the argument is its branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ の未コミットの変更を移動する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy ignored files from the project folder": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: copy the files Git ignores that Project Settings names into the new worktree",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git が無視するファイルをプロジェクトのフォルダからコピーする"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moves staged and unstaged changes and untracked files into the new worktree, and removes them from %@.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet, VoiceOver: hint of the carry's checkbox; the argument is the shown worktree's branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ステージ済みと未ステージの変更、および追跡していないファイルを新しいワークツリーに移動し、%@ から削除します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Open Pull Requests": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: the menu of open pull requests, with none",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オープンの PR なし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: open nothing in the worktree once it is made",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "なし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start From": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: label of where the branch comes from, a new one or an existing one",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作成元"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creates the worktree from the latest state of the remote branch, not from an older local copy.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet, VoiceOver: hint of the fetch checkbox",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ローカルの古いコピーではなく、リモートのブランチの最新の状態からワークツリーを作成します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install %@ to create worktrees from pull requests.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: why the Pull Request source is off; the argument is gh or glab",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PR からワークツリーを作成するには、%@ をインストールしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No base branch was found.": {
      "comment": "New worktree sheet: no default branch and no current branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベースブランチが見つかりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t move the changes from %@ into this worktree. They’re still in %@, unchanged.": {
      "comment": "New worktree: the changes could not be put here; the argument, twice, is the worktree they stay in",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t move the changes from %1$@ into this worktree. They’re still in %2$@, unchanged."
          }
