        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ の変更をこのワークツリーに移動できませんでした。変更は %2$@ にそのまま残っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moved the changes here. %@ changed during the move, so its changes were also left in place.": {
      "comment": "New worktree: the changes came along but were not taken out of the source; the argument is the source's branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更をこのワークツリーに移動しました。移動中に %@ が変更されたため、元の変更も削除せずに残しています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moved the changes here. Some couldn’t be removed from %@.": {
      "comment": "New worktree: the source was cleared part way and no copy could be stored; the argument is the source's branch",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更をこのワークツリーに移動しました。%@ から削除できなかった変更があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moved the changes here. Some couldn’t be removed from %@, so a copy was saved as the stash “%@”.": {
      "comment": "New worktree: the source was cleared part way; the source's branch, then the stash entry's name",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moved the changes here. Some couldn’t be removed from %1$@, so a copy was saved as the stash “%2$@”."
